      "text": "proxy.ts  \u2014  cookie gate on every route  \u00b7  ufa_session + ufa_persona  \u00b7  keeps the Contact persona fenced inside /portal\nConvenience only: real authorisation is Odoo's own ACLs and record rules on every call.",
