      "width": 896.0,
      "height": 109.375,
      "text": "App Router pages  (React Server Components)\n\nDashboard \u00b7 Contacts \u00b7 Products \u00b7 Chart of accounts \u00b7 Journals\nAnalytic accounts \u00b7 Sales \u00b7 Purchases \u00b7 Journal entries\nBudgets \u00b7 Reports (Balance Sheet / P&L / Budget) \u00b7 Users\n/portal/invoices  \u2014  the Contact persona's whole world\nlogin \u00b7 signup \u00b7 forgot-password \u00b7 reset-password",
      "originalText": "App Router pages  (React Server Components)\n\nDashboard \u00b7 Contacts \u00b7 Products \u00b7 Chart of accounts \u00b7 Journals\nAnalytic accounts \u00b7 Sales \u00b7 Purchases \u00b7 Journal entries\nBudgets \u00b7 Reports (Balance Sheet / P&L / Budget) \u00b7 Users\n/portal/invoices  \u2014  the Contact persona's whole world\nlogin \u00b7 signup \u00b7 forgot-password \u00b7 reset-password",
