      "width": 1368,
      "height": 46.875,
      "text": "Route handlers  /api/*\nauth (login \u00b7 logout \u00b7 signup \u00b7 forgot \u00b7 reset)   \u00b7   admin/users (Admin creates Invoicing and Customer logins)   \u00b7   payments (razorpay \u00b7 finalize)\ninvoices (pdf \u00b7 status)   \u00b7   dashboard/summary (live KPIs)   \u00b7   odoo/call (read-only picker proxy)",
