      "text": "controllers/main.py  \u2014  /urban_furniture/*\ngroup_ids (persona lookup)   \u00b7   signup   \u00b7   password reset request / info / confirm   \u00b7   admin_create_invoicing_user   \u00b7   admin_create_customer_login\nEach sudo()'d only after re-checking the caller's group server-side \u2014 res.users writes are Settings-only in stock Odoo.",
